Package: ContextNet
Title: scMultiomics-Enhanced Cell-Cell Communication Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: ContextNet extends the NicheNet framework by incorporating gene
    regulatory networks (GRNs) constructed from single-cell multiomics data.
    The package provides GRN import from various sources, network integration
    with NicheNet prior knowledge networks, and streamlined analysis functions
    for cell-cell communication inference.
